# Project rules: AI chatbot app

- Call the LLM API only from server code. The API key never reaches the browser.
- Keep the model name and settings in one config place. Use the exact model ID I give you. Don't invent model names.
- Set a max output tokens value, and limit message length and requests per user.
- Show a clear error message when the API fails or rate-limits. Never show raw error objects to users.
- Don't log full conversations with personal data unless I ask. If we log, say where and for how long.
- Keep the system prompt in its own file so I can edit it without touching code.
